meta {
  name: Rooms
  type: folder
}

docs {
  # Room Management API

  This folder contains all room-related endpoints for Phase 2.

  ## Features
  - Room CRUD operations
  - Photo gallery management
  - Real-time availability checking
  - Room type listings
  - Price and capacity filtering

  ## Authentication
  Protected endpoints require Bearer token authentication.
  Use the token from login response.

  ## Endpoints
  - Public: View rooms, check availability, search
  - Protected: Create, update, delete rooms (HOST/ADMIN only)
  - Owner: Modify own hotel's rooms only

  ## Key Features
  - Multi-room inventory management
  - Prevents double booking
  - Dynamic pricing
  - Guest capacity validation
  - Date range availability
}
